WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:02.634
-Hey, finally guys,
it's time for "Pros and Cons."

00:00:02.634 --> 00:00:03.901
Here we go.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:03.901 --> 00:00:08.267
-♪ Pros and cons
and pros and cons and pros ♪

00:00:08.267 --> 00:00:10.334
-Now, tonight,
we'll be taking a look

00:00:10.334 --> 00:00:14.934
at the pros and cons of
JetBlue buying Spirit Airlines.

00:00:14.934 --> 00:00:16.667
It was just announced
that JetBlue

00:00:16.667 --> 00:00:18.734
is attempting to purchase
Spirit Airlines.

00:00:18.734 --> 00:00:21.000
Yeah, this could mean a lot
of changes to the way we fly,

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:22.567
so let's take a look
at the pros and cons

00:00:22.567 --> 00:00:24.367
of JetBlue
buying Spirit Airlines.

00:00:24.367 --> 00:00:25.701
Here we go.
Pro --

00:00:25.701 --> 00:00:27.467
JetBlue is offering
to buy Spirit Airlines

00:00:27.467 --> 00:00:29.367
for $33 a share.

00:00:29.367 --> 00:00:30.934
Con -- Spirit is like,
"Heck, you can take

00:00:30.934 --> 00:00:32.100
the whole plane for $25."

00:00:32.100 --> 00:00:38.033
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:38.033 --> 00:00:40.400
Pro -- JetBlue promises
to bring all-new features

00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:42.100
to Spirit planes.

00:00:42.100 --> 00:00:43.767
Con -- like "pilots."

00:00:43.767 --> 00:00:45.434
[ Laughter ]

00:00:45.434 --> 00:00:46.834
You're gonna want those.

00:00:46.834 --> 00:00:48.167
[ Applause ]

00:00:48.167 --> 00:00:50.234
Pro -- now the two airlines
can join forces

00:00:50.234 --> 00:00:52.334
and get back to doing
what they do best.

00:00:52.334 --> 00:00:54.534
Con -- inventing new ways
to charge for luggage.

00:00:54.534 --> 00:00:56.033
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:56.033 --> 00:00:57.901
"Uh, it's too small.

00:00:57.901 --> 00:00:59.868
It's too small.
You gotta pay $5.

00:00:59.868 --> 00:01:01.334
Small luggage."
[ Laughter ]

00:01:01.334 --> 00:01:02.701
-"It's got a handle."

00:01:02.701 --> 00:01:04.100
-"Yeah. Oh, it's a wallet.
Yeah."

00:01:04.100 --> 00:01:05.667
[ Laughter ]

00:01:05.667 --> 00:01:08.067
Pro -- JetBlue
is attempting the purchase

00:01:08.067 --> 00:01:09.634
through a hostile takeover.

00:01:09.634 --> 00:01:11.601
Con -- a hostile takeover
is how Spirit

00:01:11.601 --> 00:01:13.067
describes
their boarding process.

00:01:13.067 --> 00:01:14.934
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:14.934 --> 00:01:17.868
"I have Baltic!
I have Baltic!"

00:01:17.868 --> 00:01:19.200
[ Applause ]

00:01:19.200 --> 00:01:20.934
Pro -- JetBlue
wanted to sit down

00:01:20.934 --> 00:01:22.901
with Spirit Airlines
and make a deal.

00:01:22.901 --> 00:01:24.901
Con --
Spirit doesn't do "seats."

00:01:24.901 --> 00:01:28.634
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:28.634 --> 00:01:30.100
Everyone just standing, hold --

00:01:30.100 --> 00:01:31.267
[ Laughter ]

00:01:31.267 --> 00:01:33.767
Hold the pole.

00:01:33.767 --> 00:01:34.968
[ Laughter ]

00:01:34.968 --> 00:01:37.234
-"Next.
Go ahead."

00:01:37.234 --> 00:01:39.234
-"You can go ahead."
[ Laughter ]

00:01:39.234 --> 00:01:41.300
"You can go ahead, if you want."
-"Wait, wait, wait."

00:01:41.300 --> 00:01:43.000
-"You can fly it, if you want.
I don't care."

00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:44.534
[ Laughter ]
-"Wait, stop.

00:01:44.534 --> 00:01:46.934
Where'd you get those shoes?"
[ Laughter ]

00:01:46.934 --> 00:01:49.601
-Pro -- Spirit stockholders
have a lot of questions.

00:01:49.601 --> 00:01:50.901
Con -- like,
"How drunk was I

00:01:50.901 --> 00:01:52.467
when I bought stock
in Spirit Airlines?"

00:01:52.467 --> 00:01:57.601
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:57.601 --> 00:02:00.434
Pro -- Spirit's stock rose
in anticipation of the merger.

00:02:00.434 --> 00:02:02.067
Con -- it's the first time
anything from Spirit

00:02:02.067 --> 00:02:04.367
has ever gained altitude.
"Oh, yeah, we did it!"

00:02:04.367 --> 00:02:06.534
[ Applause ]

00:02:06.534 --> 00:02:08.367
And, finally, pro --
Spirit and JetBlue

00:02:08.367 --> 00:02:09.868
will be combining forces.

00:02:09.868 --> 00:02:11.701
Con --
to create "Spue Airlines."

00:02:11.701 --> 00:02:13.400
There you have it.
Those are the "Pros and Cons."

00:02:13.400 --> 00:02:14.968
We have a great show!

